{"id":"sdelka","lemma":"сделка","pos":"noun","rank":1270,"glosses":["deal, bargain","transaction (the act of conducting or carrying out business, negotiations, plans, etc.)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/35/Ru-%D1%81%D0%B4%D0%B5%D0%BB%D0%BA%D0%B0.ogg/Ru-%D1%81%D0%B4%D0%B5%D0%BB%D0%BA%D0%B0.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"сделки","plural":"сделки"},"examples":[{"text":"Это хорошая сделка.","en":"It's a good deal.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"good, nice, fine","l":"хороший"},null]},{"text":"Это не плохая сделка.","en":"It's not a bad deal.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"bad","l":"плохой"},null]},{"text":"Я думаю, что это была хорошая сделка.","en":"I thought that was a good deal.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to think","l":"думать"},null,null,{"g":"was","l":"быть"},{"g":"good, nice, fine","l":"хороший"},null],"phrases":[[2,4,"why"]]},{"text":"Сделка отменяется.","en":"The deal is off.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1264702","words":[null,null]},{"text":"Они сказали, что сделка не состоится.","en":"They said the deal was off.","words":[{"g":"they"},{"g":"to say, to tell","l":"сказать"},{"g":"what / that"},null,{"g":"not"},null]}]}